<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Zoo Guide Layout</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
    background-color: #eef3f6;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .container {
    display: flex;
    width: 550px;
    background-color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Background decorative elements */
  .bg-blob-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 200px;
    height: 150px;
    background-color: #e6f0f5;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 100%;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .bg-blob-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 150px;
    height: 200px;
    background-color: #f0f0f5;
    border-top-right-radius: 100%;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .vertical-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 90px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background-color: #2c3e50;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .vertical-line::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    left: -4px;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #2c3e50;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .sidebar {
    width: 90px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 30px;
    z-index: 2;
    background-color: transparent;
  }
  .sidebar-char {
    background-color: #4a7a8c;
    color: white;
    font-size: 24px;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .sidebar-route {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .route-char {
    border: 1px solid #333;
    font-size: 20px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: white;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .route-arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 8px solid transparent;
    border-right: 8px solid transparent;
    border-top: 12px solid #888;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .number-6 {
    margin-top: 80px;
    font-size: 90px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #4bc5c3;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #fff, 4px 4px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    font-style: italic;
    position: relative;
  }
  .number-6::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: -10px;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #ff6b6b;
  }

  /* Main Content */
  .main-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 20px 30px 30px 40px;
    z-index: 2;
    position: relative;
  }

  .top-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    color: #4a7a8c;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .top-header .placeholder {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 12px;
    background-color: #eee;
    border: 1px dashed #ccc;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sign-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sign-board-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 160px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
  }
  .sign-board {
    border: 3px solid #5c8a9c;
    border-radius: 15px;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #5c8a9c;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 18px;
    background-color: white;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    line-height: 1.3;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px rgba(92, 138, 156, 0.2);
  }

  .photo-placeholder {
    background-color: #ddd;
    border: 5px solid white;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 12px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .photo-1 { width: 180px; height: 120px; transform: rotate(4deg); margin-top: -30px; margin-left: 10px; }
  .photo-2 { width: 120px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-4deg); margin-top: -10px; margin-left: 40px; }
  .photo-3 { width: 180px; height: 120px; transform: rotate(-2deg); margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 10px; }

  .desc-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #000;
    text-align: justify;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  /* SVG Arrows */
  .path-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .arrow-1 {
    left: 60px;
    bottom: -55px;
  }
  .arrow-2 {
    left: 60px;
    bottom: -55px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <div class="bg-blob-top"></div>
  <div class="bg-blob-bottom"></div>

  <div class="vertical-line"></div>

  <div class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-char">步</div>
    <div class="sidebar-char">行</div>
    <div class="sidebar-char">游</div>
    <div class="sidebar-char">览</div>
    <div class="sidebar-char">区</div>

    <div class="sidebar-route">
      <div class="route-char">北</div>
      <div class="route-arrow"></div>
      <div class="route-char">线</div>
    </div>

    <div class="number-6">6</div>
  </div>

  <div class="main-content">
    <div class="top-header">
      <div class="placeholder" style="width: 80px; height: 40px; background: transparent; border: none;">[Arrow Graphic]</div>
      接上篇
      <div class="placeholder" style="width: 50px; height: 40px; margin-left: 10px; background: transparent; border: none;">[Mountains]</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="sign-container">
        <div class="sign-board-wrapper">
          <svg width="100" height="30" viewBox="0 0 100 30" style="margin-bottom: -2px;">
            <circle cx="50" cy="5" r="3" fill="none" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="50" y1="8" x2="15" y2="30" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="50" y1="8" x2="85" y2="30" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="15" cy="30" r="2" fill="#5c8a9c"/>
            <circle cx="85" cy="30" r="2" fill="#5c8a9c"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="sign-board">马达加斯加<br>丛林</div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-placeholder photo-1">[Photo: Person with Lemur]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="desc-text">
        环尾狐猴的天堂，成群结队的环尾狐猴在这里攀爬跳跃，在零距离投喂专属食物的时候有可能会跳到你的肩膀上哦，这时候就是拍照留念的最佳时机啦！
      </div>

      <svg class="path-arrow arrow-1" width="80" height="70" viewBox="0 0 80 70">
        <path d="M 20 0 L 20 40 Q 20 50 30 50 L 65 50" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="2"/>
        <polygon points="65,45 75,50 65,55" fill="#888"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="sign-container">
        <div class="sign-board-wrapper">
          <svg width="100" height="30" viewBox="0 0 100 30" style="margin-bottom: -2px;">
            <circle cx="50" cy="5" r="3" fill="none" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="50" y1="8" x2="15" y2="30" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="50" y1="8" x2="85" y2="30" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="15" cy="30" r="2" fill="#5c8a9c"/>
            <circle cx="85" cy="30" r="2" fill="#5c8a9c"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="sign-board">小熊猫展区</div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-placeholder photo-2">[Photo: Red Panda Plush]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="desc-text">
        北野里最受欢迎的网红打卡地之一，里面设有零食铺子可以购买竹叶和小熊猫互动，注：自带的食物不能给它吃哦！
      </div>

      <svg class="path-arrow arrow-2" width="80" height="70" viewBox="0 0 80 70">
        <path d="M 20 0 L 20 40 Q 20 50 30 50 L 65 50" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="2"/>
        <polygon points="65,45 75,50 65,55" fill="#888"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="section" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
      <div class="sign-container">
        <div class="sign-board-wrapper">
          <svg width="100" height="30" viewBox="0 0 100 30" style="margin-bottom: -2px;">
            <circle cx="50" cy="5" r="3" fill="none" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="50" y1="8" x2="15" y2="30" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="50" y1="8" x2="85" y2="30" stroke="#5c8a9c" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="15" cy="30" r="2" fill="#5c8a9c"/>
            <circle cx="85" cy="30" r="2" fill="#5c8a9c"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="sign-board">爬行动物馆</div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-placeholder photo-3">[Photo: Yellow Snake]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="desc-text">
        喜欢蟒蛇、蜥蜴的小伙伴们千万不要错过这里，黄金蟒、网纹蟒、红鬣蜥、绿鬣蜥、黑白泰加等等都有昂！PS:怕蛇的小伙伴就不要挑战自己啦！
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
